# Student Flutter App (Thkel Architecture)

App path: `apps/Qalam/` — **always use Thkel architecture** for all mobile code.

## Cursor rules (apps/Qalam/.cursor/rules/)

| Rule | Scope |
|------|-------|
| `thkel-architecture.mdc` | **Always on** — services, no hardcoding, layering |
| `qalam-core.mdc` | Always on — stack, principles |
| `flutter-architecture.mdc` | Feature folders, separated widgets/files |
| `riverpod-patterns.mdc` | Provider wiring |
| `localization.mdc` | ar/en strings |
| `navigation.mdc` | GoRouter routes |
| `api-networking.mdc` | Repository + INetworkServices |

## Thkel essentials

- **Features:** `data/` → `domain/` → `presentation/` (screens, providers, widgets/)
- **Services:** `INetworkServices`, storage, logging via `core/di/locator_providers.dart`
- **Separate files:** one widget per file, grouped in `widgets/{detail,offers,...}/`
- **No hardcoding:** `ApiEndpoints`, `AppStrings`, `AppColor`, domain `code` from API
- **Reference:** `lib/features/open_session_requests/`

## Key paths

- Router: `lib/core/navigation/routes_sercives.dart`
- Endpoints: `lib/core/constants/api_endpoints.dart`
- Network: `lib/core/services/network/inetwork_services.dart`
- Strings: `assets/translations/{ar,en}.json`

